  - id: FK_P10_03_N1
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "Day one of the wait. I've carried a lot this year that I couldn't say out loud. This was the heaviest thing I've ever held, and I said it to nobody."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e02460f0c092dde4891723eecbbdc368, type: 3}
